      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've seen forum threads mentioning ipv6, but all of the threads I've seen have more modern (within last year or two) follow-up stating that disable of ipv6 does nothing. At some point in ipv6 adoption turning it off will hurt a lot of other access to services. So you might want to turn it back on.\n\nPersonally I intermittently have this trouble so I just use the website, invite myself to friends, accept friend request etc\n\nI also saw a suggestion to use a cloudflare warp to tunnel access.",
