  "created": "2023-08-30T14:38:40.505Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There are times when I can't send invitations or receive friend invitations. Nor can I receive friend requests from strangers.\n\nI've tried turning off IDV6 or verifying the integrity of the game and it only worked once, after that it didn't work, neither did deleting the game and reinstalling it",
